    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0001",
      "source": "For virtual devices with multiple constituent devices, this property returns the active restricted switching behavior conditions.",
      "ko": "구성 요소 장치가 여러 개인 가상 장치에서 이 속성은 활성 제한 전환 동작 조건을 반환합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "22b5e508b7cf16590cfe75b22a93921c449d746ead02018c66293ced9eaeeded",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0002",
      "source": "This is equal to [`primaryConstituentDeviceRestrictedSwitchingBehaviorConditions`](avcapturedevice/primaryconstituentdevicerestrictedswitchingbehaviorconditions-swift.property.md) except while recording using an [`AVCaptureMovieFileOutput`](avcapturemoviefileoutput.md) that you configure with different restricted switching behavior conditions.",
      "ko": "이 값은 [`primaryConstituentDeviceRestrictedSwitchingBehaviorConditions`](avcapturedevice/primaryconstituentdevicerestrictedswitchingbehaviorconditions-swift.property.md)와 동일하지만, 서로 다른 제한 전환 동작 조건으로 구성한 [`AVCaptureMovieFileOutput`](avcapturemoviefileoutput.md)로 녹화할 때는 예외입니다.",
      "sourceHash": "f5e3e031ca9d03e743a72885cc1bcbdf0f33d38689f7b938d4cb24d33aa6bf70",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0009:0001",
      "source": "Devices that don’t support constituent device switching return [`AVCapturePrimaryConstituentDeviceRestrictedSwitchingBehaviorConditionNone`](avcaptureprimaryconstituentdevicerestrictedswitchingbehaviorconditions/avcaptureprimaryconstituentdevicerestrictedswitchingbehaviorconditionnone.md).",
      "ko": "구성 요소 장치 전환을 지원하지 않는 장치는 [`AVCapturePrimaryConstituentDeviceRestrictedSwitchingBehaviorConditionNone`](avcaptureprimaryconstituentdevicerestrictedswitchingbehaviorconditions/avcaptureprimaryconstituentdevicerestrictedswitchingbehaviorconditionnone.md) 값을 반환합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "a1692955a99d1c5aec716d76ed298ab0b6550fc12b6ba51a12ea39253cd5d69b",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
